---
import HeroVerdictPanel from './HeroVerdictPanel.astro';
---

<section class="pt-16 pb-14 lg:pt-24 lg:pb-20">
  <div class="shell">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal">Independent verification for AI-authored code</p>

    <h1 class="h1 reveal mt-5" style="--reveal-delay:60ms">
      Your AI fixed it.<br />We check whether<br class="hidden lg:inline" /> it actually did.
    </h1>

    <div
      class="mt-11 grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:mt-14 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,480px)] lg:items-start lg:gap-16"
    >
      <div>
        <p class="lede reveal" style="--reveal-delay:120ms">
          Every AI security tool now writes its own patches and certifies its own work.
          Assay is the third party that checks. One verdict on every AI-authored change,
          before it merges.
        </p>

        <div class="reveal mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3" style="--reveal-delay:180ms">
          <a href="#cta" class="btn btn-primary">Verify a pull request</a>
          <a href="/the-index" class="btn btn-secondary">Read the Index</a>
        </div>

        <p class="mono reveal mt-5 text-[12px] text-fg-2" style="--reveal-delay:240ms">
          Free forever on public repositories &middot; Installs in under a minute
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:300ms">
        <HeroVerdictPanel />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
